Z||000000||jaguiler||05-09-2001||11:09 PM||||I was reading some posts (FieroLisa's and other below) and got reminded of this.... <P>OK OK OK - I got screwed! When I first got my car... well the morning after it refused to start for 15 minutes!! I did not know too much about the Fiero even though I have lots of experiece on other cars. Well once I got it started I took it too a tune up place. They told me the TPS was bad....<BR>They told me it needs adjustment and all that.... well I fell for it and I wanted my car running.... so they charged me $89.00 for the TPS and $100 to install it!!!!!<BR>Now knowing alot more about the car.... and seeing my TPS everytime I open the deck....I feel like an ASS**** !!!!!<BR>What should I do? Can I complain to anyone??? Any lawyers any ideas???<BR>------------------<BR>______<BR>__|aguiler<BR><P>------------------<BR>______<BR>__|||65.8.46.102||reg||1
Z||000001||FieroLisa||05-09-2001||11:14 PM||||I don't think you have much of a case, I mean they way overcharged you, but as long as they gave you an estimate before doing the work and you accepted it, there's not much to be done....<P>I'm not a lawyer or anything, but in any case, lawsuits are a big pain in my butt...I'm not sure if I'll ever see my money, for the past month or so, the sherrifs have been trying to find my mechanic to repossess his car or something for my money..yah, I know, I'm ruthless- but it goes to teach y'all a lesson- never f*ck with me and my car!!!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>||||reg||1
Z||000002||stimpy||05-09-2001||11:20 PM||||Uh, I think you are kinda boned. The cost of the part you are not going to recoup.  The labor seems a little excessive (?!) and unless they have a minimum labor rate, you could question how many hours of labor you were charged for.Threaten them with the BAR (Bureau of Automotive Repair).  I don't really understand what you hope to get out of them though. The BAR may sanction them, but that prolly wont put money back in your pocket.  I would make sure EVERYONE I knew knows that this is a rip-off joint though.||||reg||1
